- Read `AGENTS.md` first.
- Shared source-of-truth guidance lives in `ai-guidelines/`.
- Public installable skills live in `skills/adk-*`.
- Repo-only maintenance skills live in `.cursor/skills/prj-*`, `.claude/skills/prj-*`, and `.agents/skills/prj-*`.
- When shared guidance changes, use `python3 ai-guidelines/scripts/refresh_adk_skills.py scope ...` before bulk edits.
